  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The standard enthalpy of formation is defined as the change in enthalpy when one mole of a substance in the standard state (1 atm of pressure and 298.15 K) is formed from its pure elements under the same conditions.</p><p>The enthalpy of combustion of a substance is defined as the heat energy given out when one mole of a substance burns completely in oxygen.</p><p>The formation reaction of methane is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced><mi>graphite</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The heat of combustion data for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>graphite</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow/></munder><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi>Combustion</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>reactants</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi>Combustion</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>products</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow/></munder></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced><mi>graphite</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>393</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>285</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>890</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>74</mn><mo>.8</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
